Rips_RequestRandomness
├── when the round does not exist
│   └── it should revert with {RoundNotExist}.
├── when the vrf request status is not NotRequested
│   └── it should revert with {VrfAlreadyRequested}.
├── when the round is not sold out
│   └── it should revert with {RoundNotSoldOut}.
└── when the round exists, is Active, and is sold out
    ├── when the VRF coordinator returns a zero request ID
    │   └── it should revert with {InvalidRequestId}.
    ├── when the VRF coordinator returns a request ID already mapped to a round
    │   └── it should revert with {InvalidRequestId}.
    └── when the request ID is valid and not yet mapped
        ├── it should request a random word from Chainlink VRF.
        ├── it should set vrf request status to Requested.
        ├── it should map the VRF request ID to the round ID.
        ├── it should record the request timestamp.
        └── it should emit a {RandomnessRequested} event.
